00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:41.880
should be the highest in the morning,

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:44.680
within 30 minutes of waking up. This is

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:46.440
called the cortisol awakening response.

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:48.440
